362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The objective of this project is to design and fabricate an automatic roofing system that autonomously responds to environmental changes, providing protection for outdoor spaces. It aims to integrate sensors \(rain, light, and wind\) with a control unit to automatically open or close the roof based on real-time weather conditions.The project focuses on using lightweight, durable materials like aluminum or polycarbonate for the roof structure, ensuring energy efficiency and user convenience. The system will include a manual override for added flexibility and bethoroughly tested for reliability and safety in various conditions. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
