<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The smart monitoring and control system successfully achieved its goals of detecting water levels, measuring temperature, and automatically operating the pump and heater while sending alerts via GSM. It proved to be accurate, reliable, and practical. Future improvements could include cloud-based IoT integration, solar power for energy efficiency, and mobile app control for remote monitoring. Overall, the system offers an effective solution for efficient water and temperature management in both domestic and industrial settings.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [20]
>>
