/E (The literature on automated water filling systems highlights the integration of mechanical design, automation technologies, sensing mechanisms, and user-friendly operation. Researchers have investigated a variety of approaches ranging from smart pumping units, sensor-based monitoring, robotic grippers, to advanced actuation methods for precise control. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
