<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Developed a self-actuated linear drive for electromechanical systems, achieving smooth and precise motion over a 600 mm range with minimal backlash. This demonstrated how belt drives offer cost-effective and silent motion transmission for automation [1] . Proposed a smart mineral water bottle using IoT that enabled controlled pumping without contamination. The study showed that diaphragm pumps provide precise flow control, making them suitable for dispenser applications [2] . )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [13 14]
>>
