/E (A DC gear motor is a compact motor integrated with a gear mechanism to transmit motion efficiently, making it ideal for applications requiring precise control. It operates on direct current \(DC\) and uses the gear assembly to adjust the speed-to-torque ratio. This makes it perfect for automation systems like the smart water filling setup, where controlled, powerful, and accurate motion is essential. The gear motor ensures smooth operation even under varying loads, and its speed can be easily adjusted using pulse-width modulation \(PWM\) signals for optimized performance.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [3]
>>
